# Podman quadlet network unit. Filename gives the network its identity:
# `sgbr.network` -> Podman network `systemd-sgbr`, brought up by
# `sgbr-network.service`. Referenced from the two `.container` units below via
# `Network=sgbr.network`, so `sgbr-worker` and `cloudflared` share one bridge
# and can resolve each other by container name without any published ports.
[Network]
